# Cross-origin isolation headers.
#
# wllama only uses its multi-threaded WASM build when SharedArrayBuffer is
# available, and that requires the page to be cross-origin isolated. Without
# these headers it silently falls back to a single thread, which is several
# times slower.
#
# GitHub Pages cannot serve custom headers, so this file has no effect there.
# It is read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. Moving the site to either of
# them is what actually turns multi-threading on.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
